  "remainingActualAppWork": [
    "This future nine-file delta has not been applied, compiled, run or accepted. Current integrated140 uses the unchanged canonical chapter source; all seven new methods are definitions, not execution evidence.",
    "The old startup UserDefaults shelf migration still uses try? migrated.write then markMetadataPersisted; it is before ordinary grants and is not repaired or claimed durable here.",
    "Legacy synchronous import/sync apply APIs still wait on the existing persist queue. Their active-owner encoded payload merge and old ordinary writer error logging remain incomplete; this delta does not claim all default App main-thread I/O or all owner failure paths fixed.",
    "If four revision-checked bookmark publication attempts cannot stabilize after durable replacement, the migration fails and retains its journal plus bounded accepted projection rather than falsely acknowledging indexes. Automatic recovery of such in-process pinned migration ownership remains to be completed; restart re-reads actual durable metadata.",
